{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794582910874,"sessionID":"ses_e2a8827beffe2WRM5fapKnxmNx","part":{"partID":"prt_1d57a0d1c001KLGzIxxwfwptJ7","sessionID":"ses_e2a8827beffe2WRM5fapKnxmNx","messageID":"msg_1d57a007b001QR6k9Y1Bw1ujEx","type":"tool","id":"call_00_sg6pab5TEIMDmeQxh2HB9657","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"| **skill** | `/create:sk-skill <skill-name> [operation] [type] [--path <dir>] [--chained] [:auto\\|:confirm]` | Unified skill workflow (full-create, full-update, reference-only, asset-only) |","oldString":"| **skill** | `/create:skill <skill-name> [operation] [type] [--path <dir>] [--chained] [:auto\\|:confirm]` | Unified skill workflow (full-create, full-update, reference-only, asset-only) |","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/create/README.txt"},"output":"Edited .skilled/commands/create/README.txt (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/commands/create/README.txt","patch":"Index: .skilled/commands/create/README.txt\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/commands/create/README.txt\n+++ .skilled/commands/create/README.txt\n@@ -53,9 +53,9 @@\n | **goal** | `/create:goal <packet path> [top-level\\|phase-parent\\|child\\|retrofit\\|phase-add\\|amend] [:auto\\|:confirm]` | Author or revise a packet `goal.md` for top-level, phase-parent, child, retrofit, phase-add and amend |\n | **manual-testing-playbook** | `/create:manual-testing-playbook <skill-name> [create\\|update] [--path <dir>] [:auto\\|:confirm]` | Create or update a rooted `manual-testing-playbook/` package using the shipped `sk-doc` contract |\n | **readme** | `/create:readme <target> [--type <project\\|component\\|feature\\|skill>] [--output <path>] [:auto\\|:confirm]` | Folder README creation with `sk-doc` quality standards |\n | **repo-rule** | `/create:repo-rule <what the rule should bind> [create\\|revise\\|retire] [--rule <name>] [:auto\\|:confirm]` | Create, revise or retire a repo rule under `repo-rules/`, wired into `REPO RULES.md` |\n-| **skill** | `/create:skill <skill-name> [operation] [type] [--path <dir>] [--chained] [:auto\\|:confirm]` | Unified skill workflow (full-create, full-update, reference-only, asset-only) |\n+| **skill** | `/create:sk-skill <skill-name> [operation] [type] [--path <dir>] [--chained] [:auto\\|:confirm]` | Unified skill workflow (full-create, full-update, reference-only, asset-only) |\n | **skill-parent** | `/create:skill-parent <skill-name> [create\\|update] [--modes <m1,m2,...>] [--surfaces <s1,s2,...>] [--path <dir>] [:auto\\|:confirm]` | Scaffold a parent skill with nested mode packets (one hub identity, `mode-registry.json` source of truth, and a root `ROUTER.md` stage-two control document) |\n | **with-human-voice** | `/create:with-human-voice <file or passage> [apply\\|score] [--include-code] [:auto\\|:confirm]` | Apply or score prose against the Human Voice Rules with a scope gate and a re-scan |\n \n ### README Types\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/commands/create/README.txt (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"| **skill** | `/create:sk-skill <skill-name> [operation] [type] [--path <dir>] [--chained] [:auto\\\\|:confirm]` | Unified skill workflow (full-create, full-update, reference-only, asset-only) |\", \"oldString\": \"| **skill** | `/create:skill <skill-name> [operation] [type] [--path <dir>] [--chained] [:auto\\\\|:confirm]` | Unified skill workflow (full-create, full-update, reference-only, asset-only) |\", \"path\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/create/README.txt\"}"},"time":{"start":1794582908188,"end":1794582910874}}}}
