{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794582910885,"sessionID":"ses_e2a8827beffe2WRM5fapKnxmNx","part":{"partID":"prt_1d57a1198001XMUIg5Ordwk213","sessionID":"ses_e2a8827beffe2WRM5fapKnxmNx","messageID":"msg_1d57a007b001QR6k9Y1Bw1ujEx","type":"tool","id":"call_02_ALKQ0QgwxVgBHRBRsKR52942","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"The `--chained` flag on `/create:sk-skill` doc-only operations indicates parent workflow handoff.","oldString":"The `--chained` flag on `/create:skill` doc-only operations indicates parent workflow handoff.","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/create/README.txt"},"output":"Edited .skilled/commands/create/README.txt (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/commands/create/README.txt","patch":"Index: .skilled/commands/create/README.txt\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/commands/create/README.txt\n+++ .skilled/commands/create/README.txt\n@@ -115,9 +115,9 @@\n Each mode loads a separate YAML workflow from `assets/` when that command ships YAML assets:\n - Auto: `create-<command>-auto.yaml`\n - Confirm: `create-<command>-confirm.yaml`\n \n-The `--chained` flag on `/create:skill` doc-only operations indicates parent workflow handoff.\n+The `--chained` flag on `/create:sk-skill` doc-only operations indicates parent workflow handoff.\n \n The documentation-package commands preserve the live `sk-doc` contracts:\n - `/create:feature-catalog` produces `feature-catalog/feature-catalog.md` plus bare descriptive-slug category folders (the root catalog owns display order)\n - `/create:manual-testing-playbook` produces `manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md` plus bare descriptive-slug category folders (the root playbook owns display order) and no sidecar review/ledger files\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/commands/create/README.txt (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"The `--chained` flag on `/create:sk-skill` doc-only operations indicates parent workflow handoff.\", \"oldString\": \"The `--chained` flag on `/create:skill` doc-only operations indicates parent workflow handoff.\", \"path\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/create/README.txt\"}"},"time":{"start":1794582909336,"end":1794582910885}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794582910890,"sessionID":"ses_e2a8827beffe2WRM5fapKnxmNx","part":{"partID":"prt_1d57a13660016Ic4HxZ90N3WQG","sessionID":"ses_e2a8827beffe2WRM5fapKnxmNx","messageID":"msg_1d57a007b001QR6k9Y1Bw1ujEx","type":"tool","id":"call_03_3vV8kdGKU3luiBQ5Satu2927","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"/create:sk-skill my-new-skill full-create :auto","oldString":"/create:skill my-new-skill full-create :auto","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/create/README.txt"},"output":"Edited .skilled/commands/create/README.txt (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/commands/create/README.txt","patch":"Index: .skilled/commands/create/README.txt\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/commands/create/README.txt\n+++ .skilled/commands/create/README.txt\n@@ -133,9 +133,9 @@\n # Create a README for a specific folder\n /create:readme readme .skilled/skills/my-skill --type skill :confirm\n \n # Create a full skill\n-/create:skill my-new-skill full-create :auto\n+/create:sk-skill my-new-skill full-create :auto\n \n # Scaffold a parent skill with nested mode packets\n /create:skill-parent my-loop-workflows create --modes research,review,ai-council :confirm\n \n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/commands/create/README.txt (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"/create:sk-skill my-new-skill full-create :auto\", \"oldString\": \"/create:skill my-new-skill full-create :auto\", \"path\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/create/README.txt\"}"},"time":{"start":1794582909798,"end":1794582910890}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794582910895,"sessionID":"ses_e2a8827beffe2WRM5fapKnxmNx","part":{"partID":"prt_1d57a14b4001L1l58KUlV0u872","sessionID":"ses_e2a8827beffe2WRM5fapKnxmNx","messageID":"msg_1d57a007b001QR6k9Y1Bw1ujEx","type":"tool","id":"call_04_X1GlDVNNnqSVumGV6aJe8276","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"/create:sk-skill my-skill reference-only debugging :confirm","oldString":"/create:skill my-skill reference-only debugging :confirm","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/create/README.txt"},"output":"Edited .skilled/commands/create/README.txt (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/commands/create/README.txt","patch":"Index: .skilled/commands/create/README.txt\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/commands/create/README.txt\n+++ .skilled/commands/create/README.txt\n@@ -145,9 +145,9 @@\n # Update an existing testing playbook package\n /create:manual-testing-playbook system-spec-kit update :auto\n \n # Add a reference doc to an existing skill\n-/create:skill my-skill reference-only debugging :confirm\n+/create:sk-skill my-skill reference-only debugging :confirm\n \n # Create a changelog from a completed spec folder\n /create:changelog specs/my-track/042-memory-upgrade :auto\n \n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/commands/create/README.txt (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"/create:sk-skill my-skill reference-only debugging :confirm\", \"oldString\": \"/create:skill my-skill reference-only debugging :confirm\", \"path\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/create/README.txt\"}"},"time":{"start":1794582910132,"end":1794582910895}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794582910901,"sessionID":"ses_e2a8827beffe2WRM5fapKnxmNx","part":{"partID":"prt_1d57a1662001vD05EzvXM528tC","sessionID":"ses_e2a8827beffe2WRM5fapKnxmNx","messageID":"msg_1d57a007b001QR6k9Y1Bw1ujEx","type":"tool","id":"call_05_9u21UVtpFy8RZI8n3JD10725","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"**Q: What does the `--chained` flag do on `/create:sk-skill`?**","oldString":"**Q: What does the `--chained` flag do on `/create:skill`?**","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/create/README.txt"},"output":"Edited .skilled/commands/create/README.txt (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/commands/create/README.txt","patch":"Index: .skilled/commands/create/README.txt\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/commands/create/README.txt\n+++ .skilled/commands/create/README.txt\n@@ -174,9 +174,9 @@\n **Q: When should I use `create` vs `update` for feature-catalog and testing-playbook commands?**\n \n A: Use `create` when the package folder does not yet exist under the skill root. Use `update` when the package already exists and you want to add or revise content within it. Running `create` on an existing package will produce a conflict error.\n \n-**Q: What does the `--chained` flag do on `/create:skill`?**\n+**Q: What does the `--chained` flag do on `/create:sk-skill`?**\n \n A: The `--chained` flag signals that the command was dispatched from a parent workflow (for example, a `full-create` that hands off to a doc-only phase). It changes how the command reports completion and does not affect the output files. Remove it when running the command standalone.\n \n **Q: How does `/create:changelog` determine which version to assign?**\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/commands/create/README.txt (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"**Q: What does the `--chained` flag do on `/create:sk-skill`?**\", \"oldString\": \"**Q: What does the `--chained` flag do on `/create:skill`?**\", \"path\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/create/README.txt\"}"},"time":{"start":1794582910562,"end":1794582910901}}}}
