{"type":"text","timestamp":1794582965711,"sessionID":"ses_e2a8827beffe2WRM5fapKnxmNx","part":{"id":"prt_1d57adfde001MdSQQY5k0d7mCX","sessionID":"ses_e2a8827beffe2WRM5fapKnxmNx","messageID":"msg_1d57ad1fe0011we6hfX40tal2F","type":"text","text":"T005 complete. Files written (all eight named by the task line):\n\n| File | Change |\n|---|---|\n| `.skilled/commands/create/sk-skill.md` | Router title and router-contract line now name `/create:sk-skill` |\n| `.skilled/commands/create/assets/create-skill-auto.yaml` | `Entrypoint` comment and three `next_steps` actions |\n| `.skilled/commands/create/assets/create-skill-confirm.yaml` | `Entrypoint` comment and three `next_steps` actions |\n| `.skilled/commands/create/assets/create-skill-presentation.txt` | Title, source-of-truth sentence, hard-block restart line |\n| `.skilled/commands/create/README.txt` | Command-table row, tree line `skill.md` → `sk-skill.md` (comment column kept aligned), `--chained` note, two usage examples, FAQ question |\n| `.skilled/commands/README.txt` | Command-table row and usage example |\n| `.skilled/commands/prompt/assets/prompt_improve_presentation.txt` | Next-step suggestion row |\n| `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/command-catalog-mirror-check.cjs` | Comment example rewritten as `(/group:name inside /group:name-parent)` |\n\nEvery `/create:skill` not followed by `-` or a word character was replaced. `/create:skill-parent`, `create-skill-*` asset names, mode ids and the `sk-create-skill` packet are untouched.\n\nVerify output (commands run from the repository root):\n\n```\n$ rg -l -P --hidden \"$OLDP\" --glob '!specs/**' --glob '!**/node_modules/**' --glob '!**/dist/**' --glob '!.git/**' <the eight files>\nOLD_EXIT=1            # no output: prints nothing\n```\n\n```\n$ node .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/command-catalog-mirror-check.cjs --check\n...\n  OK   commands/README.txt                44/44 listed\n  OK   commands/create/README.txt         13/13 listed\n...\nSTATUS=OK command-catalog-mirror: every catalog and hub metadata covers the command tree\nCCM_EXIT=0\n```\n\n(The one `? /create:changelog argumentHint differs from frontmatter` prose line is pre-existing and belongs to a file this task does not name.)\n\n```\n$ rg -c '/create:sk-skill' .skilled/commands/create/sk-skill.md\n2\n```\n\nTwo items you should know about:\n\n1. **One line beyond the literal instruction.** The task says to fix the tree line in `create/README.txt` only, but `.skilled/commands/README.txt` (also a named file) carried the same stale `skill.md` tree entry pointing at the relocated file. I updated it to `sk-skill.md` with the comment column preserved, because the task's own heading is \"Rename the command inside its own folder, its assets and the command catalogs\" and a catalog tree naming a file that no longer exists is the rename left half-done. Say the word and I'll revert that one line.\n2. **Not done by design:** I did not tick the T005 checkbox in `tasks.md`, and I changed nothing else — `CCM` also confirms the `create/` group still lists 13/13 commands. The only other old-name hit under `.skilled/commands` is `doctor/scripts/tests/command-catalog-mirror-check.test.cjs`, which is in `KEPT`.","time":{"start":1794582962142,"end":1794582965711}}}
